// InboundMissionService publishes mission definitions for inbound A2A calls
// (epic gibson#1367, gibson#1408).
//
// An outside A2A client can call one agent name that a tenant admin published.
// The record names the mission definition that a call starts and the targets
// that the admin approved. The definition fixes the budget and the scope. A
// message can only narrow the targets, and it can change nothing else.
//
// The right to call a published definition is an FGA grant from one enrolled
// agent identity to the definition. No default grant exists. The dashboard makes
// the identity with CreateAgentIdentity, and then it calls GrantInboundCaller.
//
// Authorization: every RPC carries a (gibson.auth.v1.authz) annotation.

